---
import type { CorpClient } from '../../data/corp/types';
interface Props { client: CorpClient }
const { client } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="corp-section corp-section-alt">
  <div class="corp-wrap">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">

      <!-- Left -->
      <div>
        <div class="corp-kicker r">Поддержка</div>
        <h2 class="corp-h2 r mb-4">Есть вопросы —<br/>спросите <em class="not-italic text-[var(--corp-or2)]">бота<br/>прямо сейчас</em></h2>
        <p class="r mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--corp-txt2)]">
          Расписание, питание, уровень подготовки, трансфер, документы — бот отвечает в любое время.
          Не нужно ждать рабочих часов.
        </p>
        <a
          href={`https://aidacamp.ru/ask?utm_source=${client.utmSource}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="r inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[var(--corp-or)] px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
        >
          <i class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Задать вопрос боту
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: chat mockup -->
      <div class="r">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] bg-[#0d1a2b] shadow-2xl">
          <!-- Window chrome -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)] px-4 py-3">
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#27c93f]"></span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.45)]">АйДаБот · aidacamp.ru/ask</span>
          </div>
          <!-- Messages -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--corp-or)]">
                <i class="bi bi-robot text-sm text-[#0d1a2b]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-sm rounded-tr-2xl rounded-br-2xl rounded-bl-2xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.88)] max-w-[80%]">
                Привет! Я знаю всё про АйДаКемп — спрашивайте.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-end">
              <div class="rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#0d1a2b] bg-[var(--corp-or)] max-w-[80%]">
                Сыну 11 лет, пишет на Python. Какой трек?
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--corp-or)]">
                <i class="bi bi-robot text-sm text-[#0d1a2b]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-sm rounded-tr-2xl rounded-br-2xl rounded-bl-2xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.88)] max-w-[80%]">
                Для 11 лет с базовым Python — рекомендую Python Advanced. В первый день педагог оценит уровень точнее.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-end">
              <div class="rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#0d1a2b] bg-[var(--corp-or)] max-w-[80%]">
                Питание входит в стоимость?
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--corp-or)]">
                <i class="bi bi-robot text-sm text-[#0d1a2b]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] px-4 py-3">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]" style="animation-delay:0s"></span>
                <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]" style="animation-delay:0.15s"></span>
                <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]" style="animation-delay:0.3s"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
